nservative party well i very rarely  get the chance to sit at home in front  of the fire  maybe that's the answer no i think the  prime minister has shown such incredible  determination and tenacity there is  no doubt that she has really worked in  the national interest to try and get  this deal through  to try and balance the interests of the  big majority 17.4 million people the  biggest democratic exercise ever  who voted to leave the eu whilst at the  same time protecting our economy  protecting jobs  and protecting the views of those on the  remain side of the argument  who want to continue to have a very  close relationship with the eu  and i think what she's offering is the  best of both worlds freedom to be  a global free trading nation whilst at  the same time keeping a very special and  deep relationship with our eu friends  and neighbors

